aper</li>", "<em>Roll Call</em>", "<li>history of Palm Beach, FL</li>", "<li>Alf M. Landon, 26th Governor of Kansas; presidential candidate</li>", "<li>John T. Rich, 23rd Governor of Michigan</li>", "<li>Ned H. Dearborn, National Safety Council president</li>", "<li>Rotary International</li>", "<li>Robert L. Williams, third Governor of Oklahoma</li>", "<li>August 1907 telegraph strike</li>", "<li>Todd Sanitarium</li>", "<p>Database numbers for today: 16075 people, 10785 with Conneautville-related events. Still working on </p>", "<div id=\"commentBox\"></div>", "<div class=\"clear\" id=\"commentForm\"></div>", "<div id=\"respond\"></div>", "<h3>Leave a Reply</h3>", "<form></form>", "<p></p>", "<input id=\"author\" style=\"\"></input>", "<label>Name (required)</label>", "<p></p>", "<input id=\"email\" style=\"\"></input>", "<label>Email (required)</label>", "<p></p>", "<input id=\"url\" style=\"\"></input>", "<label>Website</label>", "<p></p>", "<textarea id=\"comment\" style=\"\"></textarea>", "<p></p>", "<input class=\"button\" id=\"submit\" style=\"\"></input>", "<input id=\"comment_post_ID\" style=\"\"></input>", "<input id=\"comment_parent\" style=\"\"></input>", "<div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sidebar\"></div>", "<div class=\"widget_search sidebarBox widgetBox\" id=\"search-5\"></div>", "<form id=\"searchform\"></form>", "<input id=\"s\" style=\"\"></input>", "<input id=\"searchsubmit\" style=\"\"></input>", "<div id=\"footer\"></div>", "<div class=\"inside\"></div>", "<div class=\"main clearfix\"></div>", "<div class=\"oneThird widget_pages footerBox widgetBox\" id=\"pages-2\"></div>", "<h3>Pages</h3>", "<ul></ul>", "<li class=\"page_item page-item-5\"></li>", "<a>About Me</a>", "<li class=\"page_item page-item-33 current_page_parent\"></li>", "<a>Blog</a>", "<li class=\"page_item page-item-55\"></li>", "<a>Contact Me</a>", "<li class=\"page_item page-item-70\"></li>", "<a>Genealogical Services</a>", "<li class=\"page_item page-item-13\"></li>", "<a>Hiring a Gene